  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Grande Pointe Driftwood<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Conveniently located between Rosemary Beach and Panama City Beach, this newly constructed two-story 3BR/2.5BA home provides easy access to area shopping, dining, and entertainment. Grande Pointe in Inlet Beach amenities includes access to the pavilion, community pool, and a private dock on nearby Powell Lake. And you’re just blocks from the beach and Camp Helen State Park!<br><br><br><br>LIVING AREA<br><br><br><br>New construction, upscale furnishings, and contemporary decor await at this stylish home. Watch your favorite TV shows on a 50” flat-screen TV. Seat up to five guests comfortably on a queen-size sleeper sofa and two armchairs.<br><br><br><br>KITCHEN & DINING<br><br><br><br>Enjoy all new granite countertops and appliances in the spacious and well-appointed kitchen. Prepare your favorite meals on a gas range. When it’s time to eat, the kitchen island seats five, and a large wooden dining table seats six.<br><br><br><br>BED & BATH<br><br><br><br>This two-story home sleeps up to 10 guests between the three bedrooms and a queen-size sleeper sofa in the living area.<br><br><br><br>The master bedroom has a king bed, a 49” flat-screen TV, and a private balcony. The en-suite bathroom has a granite double vanity, a large soaking tub, and a walk-in shower.<br><br><br><br>The second bedroom is furnished with a king bed and a 46” flat-screen TV, while the third guest room holds two twin-over-twin bunk beds and a flat-screen TV.<br><br><br><br>The guest bathroom, stocked with a complimentary starter supply of toiletries and bath amenities, has a tub/shower combination.<br><br><br><br>A half bath located off the main foyer provides added convenience.<br><br><br><br>OUTDOOR AREA<br><br><br><br>Step onto the front porch or back patio to enjoy the fresh coastal air. There’s also a private balcony off the master bedroom.<br><br><br><br>Walk to the nearby Grande Pointe Pavilion or community pool, visit the dock at Powell Lake, or take a short 10-minute walk to the beach!<br><br><br><br>EXTRA AMENITIES & MORE DETAILS<br><br><br><br>Complimentary Wi-Fi, washer/dryer, and driveway parking for four vehicles are provided.<br><br><br><br>Please note that the dock access is not available for boat docking, it is intended for people only.<br><br><br><br>THE LOCATION<br><br><br><br>Walk 0.7 miles to nearby Camp Helen State Park -- activities include hiking, swimming, and saltwater and freshwater fishing. Plus, this prime location is sandwiched between Rosemary Beach (1.7 miles away) and Panama City Beach (14.8 miles), putting you just a short drive from an assortment of popular dining, shopping, and entertainment options.<br><br><br><br>* Please note that there is an active doorbell security camera monitored by the owner",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Home with pool & dock access - blocks to beach, Powell Lake, & state park"
        }
      ],
